<title>POLAND: WBK Q4 net rises to PLN 35.9 mln.</title>
<headline>WBK Q4 net rises to PLN 35.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>WBK results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		    44.77    vs  46.94</p>
<p>    net				     35.92    vs  29.82</p>
<p>    pre-tax				 44.77    vs  46.94</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues  209.97    vs 183.99</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs     121.75    vs 108.70</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	  28.13    vs  18.70</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  1.26    vs   0.88</p>
<p>    income tax			     8.84    vs  17.12</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.00    vs   0.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		   223.52    vs 190.60</p>
<p>    net				    156.88    vs 115.76</p>
<p>    pre-tax				223.54    vs 190.60</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	   2.16    vs   1.08</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues  804.57    vs 682.03</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs     472.30    vs 407.20</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	  88.66    vs  65.58</p>
<p>    costs of commission		  4.57    vs   5.01</p>
<p>    income tax			    66.66    vs  74.84</p>
<p>    other taxes				 -    vs	-</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.01    vs   0.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Wielkopolski Bank Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
